{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12761","headline":"春申君祠 · 张继","name":"春申君祠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春申祠宇空山里，古柏阴阴石泉水。\n日暮江南无主人，弥令过客思公子。\n萧条寒景傍山村，寂寞谁知楚相尊。\n当时珠履三千客，赵使怀惭不敢言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张继","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12761.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12761","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}